--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `switch` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
int $code = 1;
switc<|>h ($code) {
    case 1:
        echo "one";
        break;
    default:
        break;
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
